status, by meaning:
  backlog   tone=muted color=6583435
  todo      tone=primary color=10980346
  active    tone=warning color=16096779
  done      tone=success color=2278750

priority, by meaning:
  urgent    tone=error color=15680580
  high      tone=warning color=16347926
  low       tone=primary color=3900150
  none      tone=muted color=7041664

labels, by meaning:
  bug       tone=error color=15680580
  docs      tone=success color=1357990
  wontfix   tone=muted color=7041664

the tone reaches the widget, which is the whole point:
  urgent bar   -> error
  done dot     -> success
  bug pill     -> error
  crit severity-> error
  completed    -> success

and badge-tone reads the same value straight off the style:
  urgent=error done=success
